	(attr through_hole)
	(fp_text_box "THD LED Pravidla\n--------------------------------------------------\nPriklad: \nLEDRD254W50D300H385-2N_FLT_FD_LL500_Green\nLEDRR254W50L500T200H700-2N_FLT_NF_LL600_SH20_SO10_Yellow\nLEDRRH254W50L500T200H700-2N_FLT_NF_LL254_Red\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSkupina LED + Radial/Axial + Tvar puzdra. \nLEDRD = Okruhla (Diameter)\nLEDRR = Obdlznikova (Rectangular)\nLEDRS = Stvorzova (Square)\nDefaultne Vertikalna montaz. Ak je horizontalne (na lezato) Prida sa {dblquote}H{dblquote}.\n\nParametre:\nLED okruhla:     LEDRD + Pitch + W + D + H - PINS + Density + _Optika + _SpodokPuzdra + _Dlzkavyvodov + 12\nLED obdlznikova: LEDRR + Pitch + L + T + H - PINS + Density + _Optika + _SpodokPuzdra + _Dlzkavyvodov\nLED Stvorcova:   LEDRS + Pitch + L + T + H - PINS + Density + _Optika + _SpodokPuzdra + _Dlzkavyvodov\n\nkde (rozmery v mm/100):\nPitch = rozteč vývodov (cca 2.54 mm)\nL   = (Lenght) dlzka tela, napr L500: 5mm\nT   = (Thickness) sirka, napr T200: 2 mm \nW   = (Width)priemer vývodu (cca 0.45-0.5 mm)\nD   = (Dimeter) priemer telesa LED (3.0 mm)\nH   = (Height) výška tela (cca 4.3-5.3 mm podľa variantu) - nie odsadenie od DPS!\nPINS+Density = pocet vyvodov a hustota (M,N,L = Most-male pady vysoka hustota, Nominal-bezna hustota, Least-velke pady mala hustota)\n12  = oznacenie vyvodov 1 a 2. Inak je A a C, alebo AG a CG - Anoda Green atd...\n\nDoplnenie tvarov tela:\nTvar optiky:\nCVX = (Convex dome) Vypuknuty obluk\nFLT = (Flat top) Rovny povrch\n\nSpodny lem:\nFR  = (Flange round) Plny lem naokolo tela \nFD  = (D-Flange) Lem v tvare pismena D - vyrez oznacuje elektrodu\nNF  = (No Flange) Bez lemu\n\nDlzka vyvodov od tela:\nLL  = (Lead Lenght) celkova dlzka kratsieho vyvodu od Spodu tela (mm/100), napr LL500: 5mm\n		Pri horizontalnej montazi je LL od spodu tela po zahnutie do DPS\n\nMinimalna montazna vyska:\nSH  = (SeatingHeight) minima;lna vyska spodu tela od DPS - niektore vyvody maju lom pod puzdrom\n\nMontazna vyska\nSO  = (StandOff) nadvihnutie puzdra nad DPS, kedze vyvody su dostatocne dlhe, moze sa puzdro {dblquote}vysunut{dblquote}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDescription field:\nLED Radial Diameter Vertical Mount, Dia: 3.0, Body Height: 3.85, 2 pins Nominal, Flat Top, D-Flange, Pin Length:5.00, Green\n--------------------------------------------------\nTag\nLED"
